cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this teaching resource, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Lyα: from gas to forest — an interactive, provenance-traced teaching resource on the Lyman-α forest"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jibancat/lya-gas-to-forest"
url: "https://jibancat.github.io/lya-gas-to-forest/"
license: ["MIT", "CC-BY-4.0", "CC0-1.0"]
date-released: "2026-10-05"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ho"
    given-names: "Ming-Feng"
abstract: >-
  An interactive browser resource that follows neutral hydrogen between a quasar and us into the Lyman-α forest:
  resonant scattering, thermal and natural broadening, cosmological redshift, the map from real space to velocity
  space, optical depth, transmitted flux, instrument effects and the inverse problem. Every scientific claim is linked
  to its sources, assumptions and numerical validation, generated from a machine-readable science ledger.
keywords:
  - Lyman-alpha forest
  - intergalactic medium
  - spectroscopy
  - cosmology education
  - interactive visualization
